# End-to-end EMULATOR test: BIGTREETECH SKR V1.4 (NXP LPC1768) under
# Renode in tick mode. Boots real firmware, completes identify +
# clocksync, brings up the full config (4 TMC2208s, 2 software-PWM
# heaters, fan, endstops, 2 thermistors) and round-trips M114/M105.
# See "Per-printer tests" in test/emulator/README.md for the shared
# conventions.
#
# Ground specific to this board:
#   - SINGLE-WIRE-PER-DRIVER TMC UART: each TMC2208 has its own
#     uart_pin (P1.10/P1.9/P1.8/P1.4, rx == tx, no multi-drop address).
#     A TMC2208 request carries no pin identity, so renode_hooks.sw_uart
#     broadcasts each framed reply to every registered RX pin; klippy
#     initialises and reads the drivers sequentially, so the shared
#     register file lines up and per-driver IFCNT verify passes.
#   - IRQ-DRIVEN ADC: src/lpc176x/adc.c collects burst samples in
#     ADC_IRQHandler, so nothing completes a read unless the interrupt
#     fires. repl/lpc176x_adc.cs raises ADC_IRQn (nvic@22) per
#     conversion. The temp=3 assertion below is the positive proof that
#     the IRQ path delivered samples (a broken IRQ path reads temp=0.0
#     with no shutdown).
#   - test_klippy.py emits sw_uart for LPC "Pn.m" pin names, and
#     sw_uart drives RX via the LPC fast-GPIO FIOPIN register.
DICTIONARY lpc176x.dict
CONFIG skr_v1_4.cfg
EMULATOR skr_v1_4.fixture.json
REQUIRES_EMULATOR  # deterministic-time lockstep needs the real backend

M114
M105
DUMP_TMC STEPPER=stepper_x
DUMP_TMC STEPPER=extruder

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Configured MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "DUMP_TMC stepper_x"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "DUMP_TMC extruder"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "version=0x21"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "temp=3"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "failed to init"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Unable to read tmc uart"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Unable to write tmc uart"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Got EOF when reading from device"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "failed to init: Timeout"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "ADC out of range"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Timer too close"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Rescheduled timer in the past"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
